Following the skill's JSON Structured format with nested camera/scene/action/audio per shot, plus the Reference Mode role declarations the skill requires.

{
  "references": {
    "image_1": "first_frame — door opening, hero exits classroom into magical hallway",
    "image_2": "intermediate — demon appears from left, hero shocked",
    "image_3": "intermediate — hero panics, slamming door closed",
    "image_4": "intermediate — hero fearless, red-violet aura activating",
    "image_5": "intermediate — demon lunges, hero charges with fist drawn",
    "image_6": "intermediate — punch lands on demon's face",
    "image_7": "intermediate — demon launched back, mid-air rotation",
    "image_8": "intermediate — demon slams into locker wall",
    "image_9": "last_frame — reverse angle, demon dissolving, bat flying off, hero victorious"
  },
  "style": "Painterly anime illustration, hand-drawn line work, cel-shaded surfaces, deep violet and warm orange palette, magical castle hallway environment. Every frame illustrated. No photographic or live-action frames.",
  "global": {
    "environment": "Magical castle hallway with weathered stone walls, glowing bioluminescent vines on the ceiling, floating violet and blue orbs, broken stone floor tiles, arcane runes glowing on walls, heavy medieval wooden door, metal lockers along one wall.",
    "lighting": "Deep violet ambient with warm orange spill from doorway. Aura light builds across sequence — red-violet for hero, residual smoke for demon."
  },
  "shots": [
    {
      "shot": 1,
